    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83e\udd87Wishlist Today!\ud83e\udd87</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd87Discover the origins of Dracula in this classics-inspired JRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dracula is a full-length free game, a prequel to\u00a0Dracula: A Gothic RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7bIt's a golden-age of peace, and everyone is happy in this little cozy town of Westminster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex was just an average boy until that one fateful night, then his whole life changed forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 years ago a mysterious old man left a strange amulet to protect against great evil, but once Alex finds the amulet......his fate is sealed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex  transforms into a vampire by The Dark One (the Guardian of Darkness).  He wants Alex to fulfill the prophecy and become The Chosen One...\u00a0 Dracula, who will help the lost &amp; abandoned souls move into the afterlife, for all of eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alex agrees to the magick contract and bonds with [The Dark One] as his Guardian Summon</strong>, but why!?\u00a0 Play and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660680/extras/da736ffc3602e89d17966f09a27b9aa2.poster.avif?t=1748472493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660680/extras/da736ffc3602e89d17966f09a27b9aa2.webm?t=1748472493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660680/extras/da736ffc3602e89d17966f09a27b9aa2.mp4?t=1748472493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\ud83e\udd87<strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfa Classic Role-Playing Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 2.5D graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 Rich Storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf86 Unique magic, skills, and items only found in the Dracula series</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7b Surprises and treasure hidden in every corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e\u200e\u200f\u200f\u200e \u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200f\u200f\u200e \u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200f\u200f\u200e \u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200f\u200f\u200e \u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd87<strong>inspired by Chrono Trigger, Earthbound, and Breath of Fire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rediscover all the nostalgic charm today's RPGs are missing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+Dialogue can't be skipped, you can't read behind signs, and all the clich\u00e9 90s RPG mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+Linear Storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+Explore towns freely to unlock new side-quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+Cheesy events and dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+Something is behind the waterfall (doesn't every classic RPG have one!?) (P.S.  It's the Grim Reaper, spoiler alert!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+In classic RPG tradition, the last boss will leave you shocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sequel to this game is Dracula all grown up: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dracula: A Gothic RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd87Discover the origins of Dracula in this classics-inspired JRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dracula is a full-length free game, a prequel to\u00a0Dracula: A Gothic RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7bIt's a golden-age of peace, and everyone is happy in this little cozy town of Westminster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex was just an average boy until that one fateful night, then his whole life changed forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 years ago a mysterious old man left a strange amulet to protect against great evil, but once Alex finds the amulet......his fate is sealed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex  transforms into a vampire by The Dark One (the Guardian of Darkness).  He wants Alex to fulfill the prophecy and become The Chosen One...\u00a0 Dracula, who will help the lost &amp; abandoned souls move into the afterlife, for all of eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alex agrees to the magick contract and bonds with [The Dark One] as his Guardian Summon</strong>, but why!?\u00a0 Play and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660680/extras/da736ffc3602e89d17966f09a27b9aa2.poster.avif?t=1748472493\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660680/extras/da736ffc3602e89d17966f09a27b9aa2.webm?t=1748472493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660680/extras/da736ffc3602e89d17966f09a27b9aa2.mp4?t=174847249